@startuml SD4_Apply_Official_Schedule
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam ResponseMessageBelowArrow true

title UC-PLAN-03: Áp dụng Lịch học Chính thức & Kiểm tra Trần Giờ rảnh (Use-Case Realization)\nTuân thủ: Craig Larman Rich Domain Model & Alistair Cockburn Hexagonal Architecture

actor "Learner" as User
box "FrontendDMZ" #F8F9FA
    participant "Next.js Web Client" as UI
end box
box "Presentation Layer" #E9ECEF
    participant "RoadmapRouter\n(FastAPI)" as Router
end box
box "Application Layer" #DEE2E6
    participant "ApplyProposalUC\n(Use Case)" as ApplyUC
end box
box "Domain Layer" #E2E3E5
    participant "AvailabilityValidator\n(Domain Service)" as Val
    participant "ScheduleProposal\n(Domain Entity)" as ProposalEntity
    participant "Roadmap\n(Domain Entity)" as RoadmapEntity
end box
box "Infrastructure & Persistence" #CED4DA
    participant "SqlRoadmapRepo\n(RoadmapRepoPort)" as Repo
    participant "PostgreSQL 16\n(Database)" as DB
end box

User -> UI: Xem xét Bản xem trước Đề xuất -> Bấm [Áp dụng Lịch]
activate UI
UI -> Router: POST /api/v1/roadmaps/{id}/apply\n{"proposal_id": "prop_456"}
activate Router

Router -> ApplyUC: execute(userId, roadmapId, proposalId)
activate ApplyUC

' --- Nạp dữ liệu ---
ApplyUC -> Repo: get_user_availability(userId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: query_user_availability(userId)
activate DB
DB --> Repo: availabilityRecord
deactivate DB
Repo --> ApplyUC: UserAvailabilityProfile
deactivate Repo

ApplyUC -> Repo: find_roadmap_and_proposal(roadmapId, proposalId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: query_roadmap_and_proposal(roadmapId, proposalId)
activate DB
DB --> Repo: (roadmapRecord, proposalRecord)
deactivate DB
Repo --> ApplyUC: (roadmapEntity, proposalEntity)
deactivate Repo

' --- Kiểm tra trần giờ rảnh ---
ApplyUC -> Val: validate_schedule_ceiling(proposalEntity.tasks, availabilityProfile)
activate Val

alt [Tổng thời lượng task vượt quá Quỹ giờ rảnh (Hard Ceiling Violated)]
    Val --> ApplyUC: HardCeilingViolationError(exceededDate, totalMinutes, quotaMinutes)
    deactivate Val
    ApplyUC --> Router: throw HardCeilingViolationError
    deactivate ApplyUC
    Router --> UI: 422 Unprocessable Entity {"error": "HARD_CEILING_VIOLATED", "date": "..."}
    deactivate Router
    UI --> User: Cảnh báo đỏ: Quá tải giờ rảnh ngày chỉ định! Vui lòng điều chỉnh trước khi lưu.
else [Thỏa mãn trần giờ rảnh]
    Val --> ApplyUC: ValidationResult(valid=true)
    deactivate Val

    ' --- Rich Domain Model: Kích hoạt nghiệp vụ trên Domain Entities ---
    ApplyUC -> ProposalEntity: apply()
    activate ProposalEntity
    ProposalEntity --> ApplyUC: status="APPLIED"
    deactivate ProposalEntity

    ApplyUC -> RoadmapEntity: activate()
    activate RoadmapEntity
    RoadmapEntity --> ApplyUC: status="ACTIVE"
    deactivate RoadmapEntity

    ' --- Lưu trữ qua Repository trong ACID Transaction ---
    ApplyUC -> Repo: persist_active_schedule(roadmapEntity, proposalEntity, proposalTasks)
    activate Repo
    note over Repo,DB: Giao dịch nguyên tử (ACID Transaction):\n1. Khóa dòng: lock_roadmap_for_update(roadmapId)\n2. Dọn dẹp: delete_pending_future_tasks(roadmapId)\n3. Batch Insert: insert_official_tasks(proposalTasks)\n4. Kích hoạt: update_roadmap_status(roadmapId, 'ACTIVE')\n5. Cập nhật official_schedules (total_sessions, total_hours)\n6. Đóng Proposal: mark_proposal_applied(proposalId)
    Repo -> DB: execute_atomic_schedule_persist(roadmapId, proposalTasks)
    activate DB
    DB --> Repo: transaction_success
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> ApplyUC: OfficialScheduleEntity
    deactivate Repo

    ApplyUC --> Router: ApplyResponseDTO(status="ACTIVE")
    deactivate ApplyUC

    Router --> UI: 200 OK {"status": "ACTIVE", "message": "Schedule activated"}
    deactivate Router

    UI --> User: Thông báo kích hoạt thành công! Điều hướng vào Màn hình Lịch làm việc.
end
deactivate UI

@enduml
